.SH "نام (NAME)"
deb\-preinst \- package pre\-installation maintainer script
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBDEBIAN/preinst\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
A package can perform several pre\-installation actions via maintainer
scripts, by including an executable \fIpreinst\fR file in its control
archive (i.e. \fIDEBIAN/preinst\fR during package creation).
.PP
The script can be called in the following ways:
.IP "\fInew\-preinst\fR \fBinstall\fR" 4
.IX Item "new-preinst install"
Before the package is installed.
.IP "\fInew\-preinst\fR \fBinstall\fR \fIold\-version\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "new-preinst install old-version new-version"
Before a removed package is upgraded.
.Sp
The \fInew\-version\fR is passed only since dpkg 1.18.5.
.IP "\fInew\-preinst\fR \fBupgrade\fR \fIold\-version\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "new-preinst upgrade old-version new-version"
Before the package is upgraded.
.Sp
The \fInew\-version\fR is passed only since dpkg 1.18.5.
.IP "\fIold\-preinst\fR \fBabort\-upgrade\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "old-preinst abort-upgrade new-version"
If \fIpostrm\fR fails during upgrade or fails on failed upgrade.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBdpkg\fR\|(1).
